  (727,'Charlie''s Angels',2000,'Action','Aspects of this take on the 1970s hit TV series are similar to the original show :Angels Dylan, Natalie and Alex still work for Charlie and interface with Bosley. They still flip their hair, stop traffic with a smile and kick butt. The differences are the unsubtle humor, the martial arts training and the high-tech premise: This time, they''re hot on the trail of stolen software.','https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/4327',NULL,9),
